# Digital Strategy Skills

This repo contains specialized skills in the `skills/` directory at the project root. Each skill has a `SKILL.md` with instructions and may include supporting reference files.

Before starting any task, check if a relevant skill exists:

| Skill | When to Use |
|-------|------------|
| `skills/digital-strategy-analysis/` | Initiative evaluation, RICE scoring, competitive analysis, roadmap prioritization |
| `skills/seo-aeo-analysis/` | SEO audits, BrightEdge data, keyword gaps, AEO, team SEO recommendations |
| `skills/web-analytics-analysis/` | GA4 analysis, Profound data, conversion funnels, team report synthesis |
| `skills/web-design-review/` | Design critique, accessibility/WCAG audits, brand consistency |
| `skills/ui-ux-research/` | Heuristic evaluation, user journeys, usability findings, persona alignment |
| `skills/web-development/` | Tracking/tagging specs, performance/CWV, component standards |
| `skills/executive-communication/` | QBRs, executive summaries, stakeholder presentations |
| `skills/strategic-project-management/` | Multi-year roadmaps, initiative scoring, status dashboards |
| `skills/technical-project-management/` | Technical implementation plans, migrations, go-live checklists, risk registers |

When a task matches a skill, read its `SKILL.md` first and follow the frameworks, templates, and workflows defined there. Also check for supporting reference files linked within each SKILL.md.

Templates for deliverables are in `templates/`. Utility scripts are in `scripts/`.
